nventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BANBA, HIROYASU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NIWA, KIYONOBU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, SHIGEHO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A powdery S,S-ethylenediamine-N,N'-disuccinic acid (S,S-EDDS) iron complex reduced in aggregation.  The complex is crystalline and has an average particle diameter of 10 to 1,000  mu m and a water content of 7 wt.% or lower.  It further has a compression strength of 1 kg/cm&lt;2&gt; or lower as measured in accordance with JIS A 1108 on a sample kept under the conditions of 50 DEG C and a load of 300 g/cm&lt;2&gt; for 2 months.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un complexe de fer poudreux de S,S-éthylènediamine-N,N'-acide disuccinique(S,S-EDDS) réduit sous la forme d'un agrégat. Ce complexe cristallin présente un diamètre moyen des particules qui varie entre 10 et 1000  mu m, ainsi qu'une teneur en eau inférieure ou égale à 7 % en poids. Ce complexe affiche par ailleurs une résistance à la compression inférieure ou égale à 1kg/cm&lt;2&gt;, telle que mesurée conformément à JIS A 1108 dans un échantillon maintenu à 50  DEG C pour une charge de 300g/cm&lt;2&gt; pendant deux mois.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>